{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>意大利數據保護機構周六表示，已對美國科技巨頭Meta Platforms處以 8.05 億歐元（約合 8.87 億美元）罰款，原因是調查發現該公司在未經用户同意且未告知用户的情況下，訪問了安卓（Android）用户的照片和視頻。這筆罰款相當於Meta全球營收的約0.47%。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:25:41.143510+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:12:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:20.651971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:19:03.381632+00:00","content_hash":"094669a27e8613fee56a80b0bdd16859dc35ee1f1b40de25692bc93ffe8189bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}